#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/graphlib/pdfio.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>pdfio</application> package contains a simple C library for"
" reading and writing PDF files."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>pdfio</application> contém uma biblioteca C simples "
"para leitura e escrita de arquivos PDF."

